{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"tool_1XKvRSranoQnP0zMDfRacbKy","content":"Title: API access to Intervals.icu - Page 36 - Guide\nSite: Intervals.icu Forum\nDate: 2020-04-01\nURL: https://forum.intervals.icu/t/api-access-to-intervals-icu/609?page=36\nSnippet: Do OAuth access tokens expire? If so, what's the lifetime? Is there a refresh-token flow, or are access tokens long-lived until the user ...\n\n---\n\nTitle: Intervals.icu OAuth support - Announcements\nSite: Intervals.icu Forum\nDate: 2021-01-30\nURL: https://forum.intervals.icu/t/intervals-icu-oauth-support/2759\nSnippet: OAuth allows external applications to request authorization to access an Intervals.icu user's data. will respond with an access token, granted ...\n\nWhen you rely on a result in your answer, cite it inline as a markdown link, e.g. [title](url)."}
